{{{{{1<noinclude>|Ability data</noinclude>}}}|Focused Resolve|{{{2|}}}|{{{3|}}}|{{{4|}}}|{{{5|}}}
|champion     = Karma
|skill        = W
|icon         = Focused Resolve.png
|blurb = {{sbc|Active:}} {{ci|Karma}} deals {{as|magic damage}} and {{tip|tether|tethers}} to the target enemy {{tip|champion}}, {{tip|monster}} or {{tip|pet}}.
|blurb2= If the tether is not broken after a short time, the target is dealt {{as|magic damage}}, briefly {{tip|root|rooted}}, and {{tip|true sight|revealed}} for a short time.
|post-blurb = Karma/Renewal
|description  = {{sbc|Active:}} '''Karma''' deals {{as|magic damage}} to the target enemy {{tip|champion}}, {{tip|monster}} or {{tip|pet}} and forms a {{tip|tether}} between her and them for 2 seconds, during which they are {{tip|true sight|revealed}}.
|leveling     = {{st|Magic Damage|{{ap|40 to 140}} {{as|(+ 45% AP)}}}}
|description2 = If the tether is not broken by the end of its duration, the target is dealt the same {{as|magic damage}} again and is {{tip|root|rooted}} for a duration, during which they are {{tip|true sight|revealed}}.
|leveling2    = {{st|Total Magic Damage|{{ap|40*2 to 140*2}} {{as|(+ 90% AP)}}}}
{{st|Root Duration|{{ap|1.6 to 2}} seconds}}
|target range = {{tip|cr|icononly = true}} 675
|tether radius= {{tip|cr|icononly = true}} 825
|cooldown     = 12
|cost         = {{ap|50 to 70}}
|cast time    = {{fd|0.25}}
|costtype     = Mana
|targeting    = Unit
|affects      = Enemies / Self
|damagetype   = Magic
|spellshield  = Special
|spelleffects = spell
|projectile   = False
|callforhelp  = True
|grounded     = 
|knockdown    = 
|notes        = 
* {{tip|Spell shield}} will block the tether's application and damage but not the aftereffects of one already applied.
* If '''Karma''' is {{tip|tether|tethered}} to multiple targets, the visual effects of all tethers will disappear at the end of the first tether's duration, but the other targets will remain tethered.{{bug}}
* If the target becomes {{tip|untargetable}}, {{tip|death|dies}}, or is no longer in {{tip|sight}} during the cast time, this ability will cancel but does not go on {{sti|cooldown}} nor pay its cost.
** If they move too far away during the cast time, however, the ability will cancel as normal but still go on cooldown and pay its cost.{{bug}}
*** {{ri|Summon Aery}} will still count as the target being damaged this way.{{bug|2}}
}}

